# API settings are read from environment variables with the VOLVOX_ prefix.
# Optional local environment file: services/api/.env
# Example keys: VOLVOX_ENVIRONMENT, VOLVOX_DATABASE_URL, VOLVOX_APP_SECRET,
# VOLVOX_OLLAMA_BASE_URL, VOLVOX_API_BIND_HOST, VOLVOX_API_BIND_PORT, VOLVOX_LOG_LEVEL
# Supabase: set VOLVOX_SUPABASE_URL or explicit JWT_ISSUER and JWKS_URL; audience defaults authenticated.
# HS256 is disabled unless VOLVOX_SUPABASE_ALLOW_HS256=true with JWT_SECRET (local migration only).
# Supabase: set VOLVOX_SUPABASE_URL or explicit JWT_ISSUER and JWKS_URL; audience defaults authenticated.
# HS256 is disabled unless VOLVOX_SUPABASE_ALLOW_HS256=true and JWT_SECRET is supplied.
